# An after story (visual novel demo): listed on the title screen's "After Stories" once ending anna
# was reached ("after story [ending anna]"; more [ending x] = all of them). It starts from a fresh
# game and has its own group of tabs on the flowchart.
title A year at the pond
description Anna, one year after you stayed.
color #7fb3ff
image ./card.svg
after story [ending anna]
event vn_demo/anna_after
end
